        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "\"section_header\": \"Introducing Gemini 4 Neon\"",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T21:35:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:47.742Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we’re introducing Gemini 4 Neon — bringing frontier-level intelligence with fast end-to-end task completion across complex software engineering, knowledge work, and science workflows.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T21:35:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:47.742Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini 4 Neon is rolling out today in the Gemini API in Google AI Studio , Gemini for business (via API and model dropdown), for paid Google AI Pro and Ultra subscribers in Google Antigravity , and for Pro and Ultra subscribers in the Gemini app .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T21:35:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:47.742Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Driving Blender MCP in Google Antigravity, Gemini 4 Neon used /swarm to build a photorealistic 3D lab bench visualizing the model names with elemental accuracy pairing Bunsen flames for Gemini 4 Carbon and Gemini 4 Hydrogen with high-voltage gas discharge tubes for Gemini 4 Ar…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T21:35:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:47.742Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In Google Antigravity, Gemini 4 Neon wrote a first-person WebGL2 freeride ski simulator from scratch on real Mont Blanc and Chamonix elevation terrain — combining 10,200 lines of custom shaders, 120 Hz ski physics across six alpine lines, dynamic carved tracks, slab avalanches…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T21:35:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:47.742Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini 4 Neon for cyber is rolling out to trusted defenders in the coming days as part of the Fairwind Program .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T21:35:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:47.742Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini 4 Neon builds on improvements from our Gemini 4 safety and security stack — maintaining Gemini 4 Carbon-level protections against severe misuse and prompt injection while advancing further on model alignment and agentic behavior.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T21:35:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:47.742Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In the Gemini app, Gemini 4 Neon excels at work that requires frontier-level reasoning and fast responses.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T21:35:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:47.742Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For enterprises: Use Gemini 4 Neon in Gemini for business (via the API or model drop-down) and Google Antigravity.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T21:35:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:47.742Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For consumers: If you’re a Google AI Pro or Ultra subscriber, you can select Gemini 4 Neon from the model drop-down in the Gemini app .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T21:35:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-20T18:34:47.742Z"
      }
    ],
